  "reading": "In a variance decomposition of cell-quarter reactive burden (log(1+UPM labour-hours)), building identity accounts for 25% of the variance (two-level ICC), versus 13% for system type, a factor of ~2. The cell (building x system) accounts for 64%, the structural counterpart of the documented persistence. Building-level factors are thus the dominant structural unit of reactive burden, yet building-level aggregate features add no predictive value (M1b): a cell's own reactive history already encodes its building's risk level. The building is the correct unit of action (inspection); the cell is the sufficient unit of prediction."
